2.","x":366,"y":533,"width":28,"height":28},{"text":"자식","x":422,"y":526,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":502,"y":527,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"자신에게","x":684,"y":527,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"적재될","x":834,"y":528,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"새로운","x":947,"y":527,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램을","x":1063,"y":528,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"가지고","x":1248,"y":529,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1365,"y":530,"width":74,"height":40}]},{"text":"이들의 차이점을 설명하기 위해서, 우선 UNIX 운영체제를 고려해 보자. UNIX에서 각","words":[{"text":"이들의","x":337,"y":658,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"차이점을","x":452,"y":657,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"설명하기","x":604,"y":658,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"위해서,","x":753,"y":658,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"우선","x":878,"y":659,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"UNIX","x":959,"y":662,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"운영체제를","x":1077,"y":660,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"고려해","x":1263,"y":662,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"보자.","x":1381,"y":663,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"UNIX에서","x":1472,"y":664,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":1659,"y":664,"width":35,"height":39}]},{"text":"프로세스는 프로세스 식별자(identifier)로 확인되는데 이것은 유일한 정수이다. 새로운","words":[{"text":"프로세스는","x":336,"y":723,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스","x":521,"y":724,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"식별자(identifier)로","x":672,"y":724,"width":323,"height":43},{"text":"확인되는데","x":1009,"y":725,"width":168,"height":40},{"text":"이것은","x":1196,"y":726,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"유일한","x":1312,"y":728,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"정수이다.","x":1431,"y":729,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"새로운","x":1589,"y":729,"width":105,"height":39}]},{"text":"프로세스는 fork() 시스템 콜로 생성된다. 새로운 프로세스는 원래 프로세스의 주소 공","words":[{"text":"프로세스는","x":336,"y":789,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"fork()","x":520,"y":793,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":658,"y":790,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"콜로","x":772,"y":792,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"생성된다.","x":853,"y":790,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"새로운","x":1013,"y":790,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1128,"y":791,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"원래","x":1313,"y":793,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1395,"y":794,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"주소","x":1577,"y":796,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"공","x":1657,"y":797,"width":35,"height":36}]},{"text":"간의 복사본으로 구성된다. 이 기법은 부모 프로세스가 쉽게 자식 프로세스와 통신할 수","words":[{"text":"간의","x":336,"y":855,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"복사본으로","x":416,"y":854,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"구성된다.","x":601,"y":856,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":765,"y":856,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"기법은","x":813,"y":856,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"부모","x":926,"y":856,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1009,"y":857,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"쉽게","x":1196,"y":857,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"자식","x":1276,"y":858,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스와","x":1359,"y":858,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"통신할","x":1544,"y":859,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1658,"y":860,"width":35,"height":38}]},{"text":"있게 한다. 두 개의 프로세스들(부모와 자식)은 fork() 후의 명령어에서부터 실행을 계","words":[{"text":"있게","x":338,"y":920,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":417,"y":920,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":508,"y":922,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"개의","x":558,"y":921,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스들(부모와","x":638,"y":921,"width":290,"height":42},{"text":"자식)은","x":940,"y":921,"width":118,"height":43},{"text":"fork()","x":1071,"y":926,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"후의","x":1207,"y":922,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"명령어에서부터","x":1291,"y":923,"width":236,"height":39},{"text":"실행을","x":1546,"y":923,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"계","x":1660,"y":924,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"속하며, 이때 한 가지 다른 점은 fork()의 복귀 코드가 서로 다르다는 것이다. 자식 프","words":[{"text":"속하며,","x":335,"y":985,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"이때","x":464,"y":985,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"한","x